      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "INPUTS",
      "role_note": "The tool's inputs, read off the config itself (ACTUAL-CODE discipline).",
      "narration_text": "It starts with three inputs: a Git U.R.L., a branch, and a config that declares the upgrade. From E.A.P. seven point two on Java eight, to E.A.P. eight on Java seventeen. Four named upgrades. And the block that matters most: protected paths. The business code and the U.I., which the tool may only touch for namespaces. Then, open a pull request.",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "estimated_duration_s": 19.7,
