      "act": "MECHANISM",
      "role_note": "Baseline: what makes 'keep business and UI as is' provable.",
      "narration_text": "Stage two is the one most migrations skip. Before a single change, it clones the repo, cuts a migration branch, builds the original app, and records every test result. Playwright screenshots the key pages. Characterization tests pin what the service classes do today. Now, nothing changed is something you can check, not a hope.",
